# === Investigation artifacts — SENSITIVE, never commit (Aragorn/Gollum/Gimli) ===
# Printer-specific TLS chain (Subject CN = serial). Keep the .example template only.
p1s-ca.pem
*.pem
!p1s-ca.pem.example
# Telemetry captures expose serial, AMS chip/unit IDs, encoded IP, job names
*.jsonl
mqtt-log-*
p1s-push_status-*
p1s-capture*
# Camera frames may reveal the physical workspace
probes/*.jpg
# Ephemeral trial logs (not findings)
*.err
probes/orca_*.log
probes/orca_help.txt
probes/disp_*.log
probes/sliced/
# NOTE: src/, p1s-ca.pem.example and probes/*.gcode(.3mf)/*.stl/*.json ARE tracked.

# === Internal development notes — relocated out of the tracked tree (release) ===
# War-council reviews, investigation logs and ops notes live on-disk under
# dev-notes/ but are not shipped. SILVER-ACCESS.md/CONNECTING.md additionally
# purged from history (they held infra access notes). Never re-track these.
dev-notes/
/SILVER-ACCESS.md
/CONNECTING.md
/REPORT.md
/FOLLOWUP.md
/SYNTHESIS-*.md
/recommend-*.md

# regenerable HA deploy bundle
homeassistant-deploy.tar.gz
